1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,001
.

2
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:52,400
When I was seven,

3
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:54,879
I had a very close friend.

4
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,159
We were playing hide-and-seek back then.

5
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,280
She followed me into an old courtyard,

6
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,159
but as it happened,

7
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,680
a fugitive was hiding there, too.

8
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:08,479
I watched helplessly as she was hurt.

9
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,000
That's why,

10
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,240
on every mission,

11
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,439
I never want you to get hurt.

12
00:02:23,919 --> 00:02:24,719
Listen to me.

13
00:02:25,159 --> 00:02:25,639
Don't go.

14
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,159
I know you're looking out for me,

15
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,280
but I can't accept that.

16
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:32,039
I have to go with you.

17
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,120
Don't you understand?

18
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:40,159
Once our cover is blown,

19
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,120
we might never make it back.

20
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,360
I understand.

21
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,599
Precisely because it's so dangerous,

22
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:47,360
I can't let you take the risk alone.

23
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,960
I know you care about me,

24
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,039
and I want you to understand, too.

25
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:03,479
I...

26
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,439
We're partners.

27
00:03:13,319 --> 00:03:14,759
Partners should protect each other

28
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,879
and watch each other's backs.

29
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,800
When facing danger,

30
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,840
why can't we face it together?

31
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:22,039
Besides, on an undercover op,

32
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:25,120
I don't want your inner loneliness

33
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,960
to make you lose yourself.

34
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,319
I want to go with you.

35
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:30,919
With me by your side,

36
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,240
at least you won't be alone.

37
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,360
All right.

38
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,919
But you have to promise me one thing.

39
00:03:54,319 --> 00:03:55,039
Once we get there,

40
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,919
if there is danger,

41
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,439
protect yourself first.

42
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,800
No matter what happens to me,

43
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,680
don't try to save me.

44
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,039
All right, I promise.

45
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:04,360
I need you to promise me, seriously.

46
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:12,800
I promise.

47
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,360
But you have to promise me too.

48
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:16,800
Come back with me.

49
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:50,360
Liang Wenbiao called and said

50
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,519
the deal is set for 3:00 p.m. tomorrow.

51
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,319
He'll let us know in advance

52
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,040
the location of the deal.

53
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,839
Did you make sure

54
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:56,839
he has the money ready?

55
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,360
Liang Wenbiao's worried online transfers

56
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,279
might expose him down the road,

57
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,639
so he insists on paying cash.

58
00:05:02,439 --> 00:05:02,959
Brother Qiang,

59
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:04,839
do you think something's off?

60
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,160
As long as he pays,

61
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,759
I don't give a damn how he does it.

62
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,240
Brother Qiang, I found out! I found out!

63
00:05:14,439 --> 00:05:15,040
Talk.

64
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,920
The waiter at the cafe said

65
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,079
that woman has a boyfriend,

66
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,000
and he's a cop.

67
00:05:19,519 --> 00:05:21,079
I bet the one who ratted us out last time

68
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,120
was definitely that woman.

69
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,399
Li Xiao hasn't been doing too well lately.

70
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,639
Find some time

71
00:05:45,439 --> 00:05:46,319
to give him a call.

72
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,879
Sister Xin, someone's here to see you.

73
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:11,560
Uncle Huang.

74
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,480
Time really flies.

75
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:21,360
In my memory,

76
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,800
you were still only in third grade.

77
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,240
Over a decade has flown by.

78
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,319
How is your mother?

79
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:30,759
She went back to our hometown.

80
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,240
Grandma is old and needs care.

81
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,639
When your father passed away,

82
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,240
I tried visiting your mother a few times.

83
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:40,040
She kept refusing to see me.

84
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:44,040
I know she harbored resentment.

85
00:06:45,519 --> 00:06:47,279
If there is anything I could do for you...

86
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,279
I understand your good intentions, Uncle Huang.

87
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:55,040
But what could you really do?

88
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:58,839
My deepest regret...

89
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:00,879
...is failing to bring your father back.

90
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,720
Whenever my mother thinks of my father,

91
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:12,519
it isn't just grief.

92
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,879
Mostly, it's hurt and resentment.

93
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,279
Every time she looks back on the past,

94
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:20,800
she can't help wondering

95
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,480
if my father ever truly loved her.

96
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:28,240
Why did he have the heart to abandon us

97
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,240
and choose his duty without looking back?

98
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,360
Back when I was in school,

99
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,360
my classmates kept asking me,

100
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:40,439
and I never knew how to answer them:

101
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:44,120
"What does your father do?"

102
00:07:45,519 --> 00:07:46,279
"Where is he?"

103
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,680
Sometimes I wonder,

104
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,399
if from the moment I was born,

105
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:57,120
I never even knew what he did,

106
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,360
would things have been better?

107
00:08:04,959 --> 00:08:07,639
Your father loved you both very deeply.

108
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,879
He once told me

109
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,639
that marrying your mother

110
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,279
was the greatest blessing of his life.

111
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,079
Yet his blessing was my mother's sorrow.

112
00:08:20,399 --> 00:08:22,240
If only we could start over,

113
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:24,600
I wish he hadn't been a cop,

114
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,879
just an ordinary man.

115
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,000
He could have done anything,

116
00:08:29,879 --> 00:08:32,360
as long as he stayed by our side.

117
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,679
As a husband and a father,

118
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:41,039
he truly owed you two so much.

119
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,519
Yet he was a police officer after all,

120
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,840
bearing a heavy responsibility.

121
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:48,399
If his soul can see us from heaven,

122
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,360
I believe his greatest wish

123
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:53,039
would be to earn his family's forgiveness.

124
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,240
During our joint border mission back then,

125
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,679
we were all fully aware

126
00:08:56,679 --> 00:08:58,039
of how dangerous the assignment was.

127
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:01,080
So we each wrote farewell letters home.

128
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:04,639
After so many years,

129
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,120
I believe your mother

130
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,919
can finally find the courage to face it.

131
00:09:08,559 --> 00:09:09,320
And you as well.

132
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,200
You should also understand the true meaning

133
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,519
behind your father's farewell letter.

134
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:15,200
The target of this operation

135
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,679
is to capture drug ring leader Cheng Fei.

136
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:22,840
Cheng Fei previously had numerous deals

137
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,519
with Country M's Drug Lord, Jessadaborn.

138
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:27,720
He possesses a vast amount of evidence

139
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:29,080
incriminating Jessadaborn.

140
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,840
But due to a deal conflict a year ago,

141
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:34,919
Jessadaborn issued a Kill Order on Cheng Fei

142
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:38,399
across Jiechan State.

143
00:09:38,639 --> 00:09:41,200
Cheng Fei's gang was hit hard by

144
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:43,919
Jessadaborn and Country M's four cartels.

145
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:45,399
According to our intelligence,

146
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:49,600
Jessadaborn is already tracking Cheng Fei.

147
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:52,399
Therefore, the key to this mission

148
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:55,200
is that once you capture Cheng Fei,

149
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:57,399
you must evade Jessadaborn's assassins

150
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,919
and bring Cheng Fei back to me alive!

151
00:10:00,039 --> 00:10:00,960
Yes, sir!

152
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,960
This seven-member tactical squad

153
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,559
will be led by Tian Zheng,

154
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,919
who will serve as overall field commander.

155
00:10:07,919 --> 00:10:08,279
Yes, sir!

156
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,679
Huang Lie will serve as deputy leader.

157
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,879
Is everyone clear on the mission?

158
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:15,879
Understood!

159
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,120
We will complete the mission!

160
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,200
Good.

161
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,639
Stay safe out there.

162
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,120
I await your triumphant return.

163
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:38,399
To my dearest wife and daughter,

164
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:41,519
This letter may be

165
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,799
my last words in this world.

166
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,879
Tomorrow, I am ordered to join

167
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,559
a secret border anti-drug operation.

168
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,799
I am proud to take part in this mission,

169
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:55,519
to protect our country and our people.

170
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:57,759
Yet at the same time,

171
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,720
I feel so guilty toward you both.

172
00:11:01,519 --> 00:11:04,120
To my wife, Aiyun,

173
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:06,399
all these years,

174
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,919
you quietly held our family together alone

175
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,639
and raised our daughter.

176
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,519
I know I owe you both so much.

177
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:19,480
If I return safely this time,

178
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,360
I will do everything in my power

179
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:26,360
to take good care of you and Xiaoxin.

180
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:28,919
But if the worst

181
00:11:30,159 --> 00:11:31,240
should happen to me,

182
00:11:31,919 --> 00:11:33,480
I hope you can find someone

183
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:34,200
who treats you well,

184
00:11:35,679 --> 00:11:37,000
to spend the rest of your life with.

185
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,519
To my beloved daughter, Xiaoxin,

186
00:11:40,519 --> 00:11:41,960
I know the greatest joy in childhood

187
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,360
is having your parents by your side.

188
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,000
Yet because of Daddy,

189
00:11:48,919 --> 00:11:50,399
we were rarely ever together.

190
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:51,799
As a father,

191
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,679
I have failed.

192
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:58,000
Because Daddy was absent from your life,

193
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:03,200
in time, I might slowly

194
00:12:04,559 --> 00:12:05,799
fade from your memory.

195
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:08,639
Still, Daddy wants to tell you:

196
00:12:09,519 --> 00:12:12,559
You are Heaven's greatest gift to me.

197
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,240
Xiaoxin,

198
00:12:16,519 --> 00:12:17,919
I hope when you grow up,

199
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:22,759
you can feel proud that your father

200
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,200
was a police officer.

201
00:13:15,759 --> 00:13:16,440
How many people?

202
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:17,679
Three of us.

203
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:19,519
Is everyone here?

204
00:13:19,919 --> 00:13:20,320
All here.

205
00:13:21,399 --> 00:13:22,200
200,000 each.

206
00:13:22,799 --> 00:13:23,919
If you're leaving, get on the boat now.

207
00:13:24,919 --> 00:13:25,480
Hold on a second.

208
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,440
Once you reach Luang Prabang,

209
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,600
someone will meet you

210
00:13:30,039 --> 00:13:31,159
and take you to Jiangyang.

211
00:13:31,879 --> 00:13:33,000
The trip from here to Jiangyang

212
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:34,120
will take a full day and night.

213
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,600
Be careful on the way.

214
00:13:35,799 --> 00:13:36,519
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

215
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:39,559
Is my brother going to be alright?

216
00:13:42,639 --> 00:13:43,799
As soon as the factory was rented,

217
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,559
the police arrived.

218
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:46,840
It seems the Country M police

219
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,759
have been watching Mr. Ma for a long time.

220
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,919
But right now, I'm not sure

221
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,519
how much evidence they have on him.

222
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,960
Keep in mind, though,

223
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,360
armed assault on police is a major felony.

224
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,759
Once Mr. Ma is convicted,

225
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:05,399
the chances of getting him out are...

226
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:12,759
Miss Li is still in Jiang Liye's hands.

227
00:14:13,759 --> 00:14:15,000
Focus on the task at hand first.

228
00:14:15,279 --> 00:14:16,799
I'll figure something out regarding Mr. Ma.

229
00:14:17,519 --> 00:14:18,639
Once you get back,

230
00:14:19,039 --> 00:14:20,360
we'll work out a plan together

231
00:14:20,559 --> 00:14:21,679
to rescue him.

232
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,399
While it's still dark,

233
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:26,360
the water police are barely patrolling.

234
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,799
Head out right now.

235
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,159
Alright.

236
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:31,799
I leave my brother to you, Mr. Qin.

237
00:14:32,519 --> 00:14:33,000
Don't worry.

238
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:35,000
Go on. Safe travels.

239
00:14:35,759 --> 00:14:36,240
Let's go.

240
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:51,919
Let's go.

241
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,399
Any movement on Liang Wenbiao?

242
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,679
The recent cases

243
00:15:01,679 --> 00:15:03,120
are all tied to Psychedelic Blues.

244
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:05,039
Got any intel on your end?

245
00:15:06,799 --> 00:15:08,600
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang will deal soon.

246
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,039
I don't know the exact time yet.

247
00:15:11,759 --> 00:15:12,759
I'll let you know once I get word.

248
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,600
Don't take any risks.

249
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:17,279
Hanging up.

250
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:41,600
Enjoying the early breeze, Fourth Brother?

251
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:49,080
This is a good spot to watch the sunrise.

252
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:56,840
You didn't bring me here for the sunrise.

253
00:15:57,679 --> 00:15:59,039
If you want to see the sunrise,

254
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:01,399
you have to sacrifice some sleep.

255
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:04,919
Everything comes with a price.

256
00:16:04,919 --> 00:16:07,159
Even the most trivial things.

257
00:16:09,519 --> 00:16:12,000
Getting philosophical, Fourth Brother.

258
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,240
Just spit it out.

259
00:16:15,519 --> 00:16:16,720
What do you really want from me?

260
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:17,759
Nothing really.

261
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:20,159
Just missed you after so long.

262
00:16:22,679 --> 00:16:23,600
That said,

263
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:25,159
usually around this time,

264
00:16:25,879 --> 00:16:27,440
you'd be coming to me for goods.

265
00:16:28,639 --> 00:16:30,600
Yet you look pretty relaxed right now.

266
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,000
So,

267
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,279
business is bad?

268
00:16:37,120 --> 00:16:39,120
Business is great, actually.

269
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,639
It's just that your supply,

270
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,559
are a bit pricey.

271
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,600
So you got your supply from someone else.

272
00:16:55,480 --> 00:16:56,200
Here's what happened.

273
00:16:56,279 --> 00:16:57,679
Some chump was skipping town

274
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:00,879
and dumped all his stash on me dirt cheap.

275
00:17:00,879 --> 00:17:02,519
With a deal like that,

276
00:17:03,879 --> 00:17:05,119
how could I say no?

277
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,680
Business is all about making money.

278
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,920
Still, we've known each other for so long.

279
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,960
When something this good comes up,

280
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,599
you didn't even give me a heads-up?

281
00:17:21,759 --> 00:17:22,920
You want to make money,

282
00:17:23,519 --> 00:17:24,559
and I won't stop you.

283
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,640
But on this deal,

284
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,000
you have to cut me in.

285
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:17,599
Tian Xin.

286
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:24,240
Can you hear me?

287
00:18:25,279 --> 00:18:26,240
Can you hear me?

288
00:18:28,599 --> 00:18:29,400
Li Xiao.

289
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,480
I want to tell you...

290
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,079
I...

291
00:18:40,920 --> 00:18:41,799
Can you hear me?

292
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,039
Can you hear me?

293
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,240
I'm on the train right now.

294
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,160
The signal's bad here.

295
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,240
What did you say?

296
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,200
You really made quite a name for yourself.

297
00:20:34,599 --> 00:20:36,039
The whole force is talking about

298
00:20:36,039 --> 00:20:37,680
your feat of taking down Huang Weiguang.

299
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:39,880
That's only because our entire team

300
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,200
is full of brave fighters.

301
00:20:46,079 --> 00:20:47,000
Why didn't that kid Lao Zhuang

302
00:20:48,039 --> 00:20:48,759
come pick me up?

303
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:50,599
Said he had a special assignment.

304
00:20:50,839 --> 00:20:52,200
He and Ge Dan were both reassigned.

305
00:20:52,319 --> 00:20:53,039
Reassigned?

306
00:20:54,599 --> 00:20:55,920
We just made progress on Qian Feng's case.

307
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,279
Why reassign the lead investigators?

308
00:20:57,759 --> 00:20:59,440
I have no idea about that.

309
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:01,400
Right now, besides Captain Bai and Lu,

310
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,880
everyone else is completely in the dark.

311
00:21:03,759 --> 00:21:04,319
Let's go.

312
00:21:04,359 --> 00:21:05,640
We're calling an emergency meeting.

313
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,160
According to the latest intel,

314
00:21:15,799 --> 00:21:16,920
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang

315
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,119
will make a deal at three this afternoon.

316
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,480
The location hasn't been confirmed yet.

317
00:21:22,359 --> 00:21:23,359
Based on my assessment,

318
00:21:23,559 --> 00:21:24,480
Liang Wenbiao and his crew

319
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:27,440
will depart from the Black Panther Club.

320
00:21:27,799 --> 00:21:29,440
So we're setting up surveillance early.

321
00:21:30,759 --> 00:21:33,279
We're split into Teams A, B, and C.

322
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,160
Li Xiao will lead Team A

323
00:21:35,519 --> 00:21:37,519
and stake out near the Black Panther Club.

324
00:21:39,039 --> 00:21:40,000
Guan Qiang, Captain Lu,

325
00:21:40,559 --> 00:21:42,319
you will lead Teams B and C,

326
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:45,160
on standby at intersections by the Club.

327
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:49,000
Sorry.

328
00:21:53,799 --> 00:21:55,200
I'm in a meeting. I'll call you back.

329
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:57,480
What's going on?

330
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:01,119
I...

331
00:22:02,039 --> 00:22:02,880
something came up at home.

332
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:03,599
Need some time off?

333
00:22:04,359 --> 00:22:04,759
No, I'm good.

334
00:22:07,039 --> 00:22:07,519
Hand it over.

335
00:22:09,799 --> 00:22:10,599
Hand it over.

336
00:22:23,839 --> 00:22:25,079
For this operation, we'll deploy

337
00:22:25,079 --> 00:22:26,599
three teams rotating surveillance

338
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:29,160
until we reach Liang Wenbiao's deal site.

339
00:22:29,319 --> 00:22:29,839
Any questions?

340
00:22:30,200 --> 00:22:30,680
All clear.

341
00:22:31,759 --> 00:22:32,200
Move out.

342
00:22:38,319 --> 00:22:38,880
You kid.

343
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:41,079
Don't let dating interfere with work.

344
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:21,400
Liang Wenbiao is on his way to the club.

345
00:23:21,799 --> 00:23:22,359
What a coincidence.

346
00:24:14,880 --> 00:24:15,880
When the deal goes down later,

347
00:24:16,039 --> 00:24:17,519
make sure you see the goods before paying.

348
00:24:22,359 --> 00:24:22,759
Brother Biao,

349
00:24:24,200 --> 00:24:25,039
what took you so long?

350
00:24:25,039 --> 00:24:25,799
Got stuck in traffic.

351
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:36,839
Ah Kai,

352
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:37,640
during the deal later,

353
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,440
stay sharp.

354
00:24:39,359 --> 00:24:40,559
If anything feels off,

355
00:24:40,839 --> 00:24:41,480
strike first.

356
00:24:41,799 --> 00:24:42,319
Got it.

357
00:25:08,519 --> 00:25:09,720
Okay, okay, got it.

358
00:25:14,519 --> 00:25:15,599
Hand over your phones.

359
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:20,599
Seriously, Brother Biao?

360
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:23,279
My girl's gonna call me soon.

361
00:25:23,519 --> 00:25:24,440
What if she can't reach me?

362
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:32,039
You got a death wish?

363
00:25:33,279 --> 00:25:34,519
Brother Biao, Brother Biao!

364
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:36,200
Just kidding! I'll hand it over!

365
00:25:37,279 --> 00:25:37,640
I'll hand it over!

366
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:39,200
Here!

367
00:26:04,240 --> 00:26:05,319
Suspect vehicle is leaving the club.

368
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:06,920
Team A, begin pursuit.

369
00:26:16,720 --> 00:26:17,160
Go after them!

370
00:26:29,079 --> 00:26:29,799
All units, be advised.

371
00:26:30,039 --> 00:26:31,440
Keep mobile surveillance on the suspect.

372
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,480
Tell your boss

373
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,759
I'm already on my way.

374
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:49,599
I'll be there in 20 minutes.

375
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,039
Got it.

376
00:26:55,519 --> 00:26:56,559
We should get moving.

377
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:02,079
Brother Qiang.

378
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,279
It's time to go.

379
00:27:07,079 --> 00:27:08,680
We have to be extra careful with this deal.

380
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:10,599
I'll get the car.

381
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,599
Turn right up ahead.

382
00:27:35,599 --> 00:27:36,440
Loop around again.

383
00:27:37,279 --> 00:27:37,680
Turn right.

384
00:27:38,319 --> 00:27:39,440
Turning right is going the long way, bro.

385
00:27:40,279 --> 00:27:41,240
What the hell do you know?

386
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:43,480
How else will we know if we've got a tail?

387
00:27:57,039 --> 00:27:58,359
The suspect changed to the side road.

388
00:27:58,519 --> 00:27:59,640
Team A can't stay on them.

389
00:28:00,799 --> 00:28:01,400
Team B, take over.

390
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:02,799
Copy that.

391
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:03,359
Stay on them.

392
00:28:03,359 --> 00:28:03,720
On it.

393
00:28:21,079 --> 00:28:21,680
Team B, pull out.

394
00:28:22,319 --> 00:28:22,839
Team A, stay on them.

395
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:23,920
Copy.

396
00:28:24,359 --> 00:28:24,720
Copy that.

397
00:28:47,519 --> 00:28:47,799
Bro,

398
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,480
once we pass the intersection up ahead,

399
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,880
turn right and we're there.

400
00:28:52,079 --> 00:28:54,119
Dana and I will go deal with Li Qiang.

401
00:28:55,279 --> 00:28:55,759
Ah Kai,

402
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:58,880
don't stick too close to us later.

403
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:01,200
Go down and scope out the surroundings.

404
00:29:01,359 --> 00:29:02,319
Your job is

405
00:29:02,480 --> 00:29:03,920
to keep our brothers safe.

406
00:29:04,319 --> 00:29:05,559
Once we get the goods...

407
00:29:11,799 --> 00:29:12,119
Speak.

408
00:29:13,799 --> 00:29:16,119
We've got a tail. Circle around again.

409
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:19,119
Got it.

410
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,079
What is it, Brother Biao?

411
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:32,119
Ah Wei, circle around again.

412
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:51,759
The suspect's vehicle has already passed

413
00:29:51,759 --> 00:29:53,119
two parking lot entrances.

414
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,680
It's not Financial City.

415
00:29:57,799 --> 00:29:58,839
We guessed wrong again.

416
00:30:12,319 --> 00:30:13,640
Team B is still at the intersection ahead.

417
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:14,559
What do we do?

418
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,000
Keep driving.

419
00:30:36,599 --> 00:30:38,599
Brother Biao, what's wrong?

420
00:30:40,400 --> 00:30:40,960
Nothing.

421
00:30:41,119 --> 00:30:42,599
Something just feels off today.

422
00:30:44,440 --> 00:30:44,920
Boss,

423
00:30:45,920 --> 00:30:48,599
you don't think the cops are tailing us?

424
00:30:52,079 --> 00:30:54,000
I suspect it's not just the cops.

425
00:31:04,039 --> 00:31:05,039
All right, got it.

426
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:09,240
The cops are onto Liang Wenbiao.

427
00:31:09,640 --> 00:31:10,559
Today's deal is off.

428
00:31:17,119 --> 00:31:18,720
Cut contact with them for now.

429
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:21,680
Still...

430
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,680
the boss wants us to dump the stash soon

431
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:24,799
and meet him in Country M.

432
00:31:24,799 --> 00:31:26,119
If Liang Wenbiao falls through,

433
00:31:26,960 --> 00:31:28,240
should we look for other buyers?

434
00:31:28,839 --> 00:31:30,920
Buyers in Nanhai who can take this much...

435
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:31,680
There aren't many.

436
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:32,359
Besides,

437
00:31:33,079 --> 00:31:34,279
the more buyers we deal with,

438
00:31:34,279 --> 00:31:35,440
the more likely we'll be exposed.

439
00:31:37,839 --> 00:31:39,400
Should we call Yunfei

440
00:31:39,559 --> 00:31:40,799
and ask how things are going in Jiangyang?

441
00:31:44,039 --> 00:31:45,599
Jiangyang police received an informant tip

442
00:31:45,839 --> 00:31:48,039
that suspect Xiao Yunfei entered our city.

443
00:31:48,359 --> 00:31:50,680
They immediately launched an operation.

444
00:32:11,839 --> 00:32:12,480
Get up.

445
00:32:12,759 --> 00:32:13,400
Take them all in.

446
00:32:14,079 --> 00:32:14,519
Move.

447
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:16,119
Hurry up!

448
00:32:20,839 --> 00:32:21,200
Captain.

449
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:22,680
Three drug traffickers captured on site.

450
00:32:23,079 --> 00:32:24,400
The other three were all shot dead.

451
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:35,200
Once the case details are compiled,

452
00:32:35,440 --> 00:32:36,759
report to the Provincial Dept immediately.

453
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:37,200
Yes, sir.

454
00:32:56,039 --> 00:32:57,359
How are things on your end?

455
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:59,039
Pretty good.

456
00:32:59,359 --> 00:33:00,200
He had too much to drink.

457
00:33:00,720 --> 00:33:02,640
Why? Is something wrong?

458
00:33:03,279 --> 00:33:04,799
Want me to wake him up for you?

459
00:33:05,279 --> 00:33:06,319
No, no, no need.

460
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:07,799
Just tell him

461
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,240
once he wakes up

462
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,599
to give home a call.

463
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,960
Sure, once he wakes up.

464
00:33:19,799 --> 00:33:20,519
Run this number.

465
00:33:20,839 --> 00:33:21,319
Yes, sir.

466
00:33:26,920 --> 00:33:28,079
Something happened to Yunfei.

467
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:50,559
The suspect suddenly called off the deal.

468
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:54,039
I suspect that while we were tailing them,

469
00:33:54,039 --> 00:33:55,039
we accidentally blew our cover.

470
00:33:56,720 --> 00:33:58,519
Today's operation was tightly planned.

471
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:01,000
Three teams took turns tailing them.

472
00:34:01,599 --> 00:34:02,359
Logically,

473
00:34:02,759 --> 00:34:04,359
we shouldn't have been spotted so easily.

474
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:07,880
I can't be sure either.

475
00:34:08,280 --> 00:34:08,880
But...

476
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,239
based on what we know of Liang's gang,

477
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,639
他们的反侦查能力

478
00:34:14,840 --> 00:34:15,840
aren't actually that strong.

479
00:34:16,119 --> 00:34:17,360
Yet for some reason,

480
00:34:17,880 --> 00:34:19,280
right from the start of the operation,

481
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,679
we lost contact with our undercover.

482
00:34:22,039 --> 00:34:23,760
Looks like they're getting more cautious.

483
00:34:25,559 --> 00:34:27,480
I bet during the next deal,

484
00:34:28,199 --> 00:34:29,480
they'll be even more guarded.

485
00:34:30,599 --> 00:34:33,559
We can only wait to reach the undercover

486
00:34:34,039 --> 00:34:36,360
to find out why.

487
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:39,199
Still can't reach the undercover officer?

488
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:40,880
No.

489
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:43,079
Could the cover be blown?

490
00:34:43,679 --> 00:34:44,159
I don't know.

491
00:34:46,280 --> 00:34:47,360
But I'm really worried.

492
00:35:04,239 --> 00:35:05,239
Ruined my plans.

493
00:35:12,079 --> 00:35:13,360
Boss, please calm down.

494
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:19,719
Brother Biao.

495
00:35:20,719 --> 00:35:22,119
Why are you looking at us like that?

496
00:35:28,519 --> 00:35:28,880
Whose is this?

497
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:30,119
Mine.

498
00:35:30,800 --> 00:35:31,440
It's a phone I just bought.

499
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:34,440
Unlock it.

500
00:35:46,159 --> 00:35:46,920
Dana,

501
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:48,159
it's not even dark yet,

502
00:35:48,159 --> 00:35:49,039
and you're calling me.

503
00:35:49,639 --> 00:35:50,039
What's up?

504
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,599
Got some good stuff again?

505
00:35:56,159 --> 00:35:56,519
Who is it?

506
00:35:57,360 --> 00:35:58,920
It's that kid from Yunding Pool Hall.

507
00:35:59,239 --> 00:36:00,320
He wants to score some stuff from me.

508
00:36:01,119 --> 00:36:03,000
Boss, you've met him?

509
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:15,320
Boss, here's my phone.

510
00:36:20,920 --> 00:36:21,519
Passcode.

511
00:36:22,519 --> 00:36:23,239
Three-three-five-six.

512
00:36:31,199 --> 00:36:33,119
Xiaokang, what is it?

513
00:36:33,159 --> 00:36:34,039
Miss me already?

514
00:36:35,039 --> 00:36:36,920
This—this is my girlfriend.

515
00:36:40,119 --> 00:36:41,800
Tonight, Xiaokang...

516
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,639
...went on a date with another woman.

517
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:46,280
No, Boss, she...

518
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,440
Boss, come on...

519
00:36:49,679 --> 00:36:50,440
Go on, go have your date.

520
00:36:52,039 --> 00:36:52,880
Get moving already.

521
00:36:54,079 --> 00:36:54,920
Thanks, Boss.

522
00:36:55,159 --> 00:36:55,639
I'm off then.

523
00:36:57,119 --> 00:36:57,880
Babe...

524
00:36:58,119 --> 00:36:59,079
Don't be mad, don't be mad.

525
00:36:59,519 --> 00:37:00,519
Boss was just messing with you.

526
00:37:02,079 --> 00:37:02,559
Brother Biao.

527
00:37:03,199 --> 00:37:03,719
Here's mine.

528
00:37:04,039 --> 00:37:04,519
No passcode.

529
00:37:05,079 --> 00:37:07,000
I only called my mom this morning.

530
00:37:07,199 --> 00:37:09,960
If you speak with her later,

531
00:37:10,639 --> 00:37:11,559
please try to be polite.

532
00:37:43,519 --> 00:37:46,159
Your call logs and text messages—

533
00:37:47,119 --> 00:37:48,480
why are they completely blank?

534
00:37:49,480 --> 00:37:51,159
I've spoken with Weizi and Dana on the phone.

535
00:37:52,239 --> 00:37:53,360
If, during the deal,

536
00:37:53,360 --> 00:37:53,920
I get busted,

537
00:37:54,400 --> 00:37:56,320
at least the cops won't find you so fast.

538
00:38:03,559 --> 00:38:04,400
Smart move.

539
00:38:06,079 --> 00:38:08,920
Take notes from Ah Kai from now on.

540
00:38:10,119 --> 00:38:10,800
Yes, Brother Biao.

541
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:16,480
All right, that's enough.

542
00:38:16,599 --> 00:38:17,880
Everyone's had a long day today.

543
00:38:18,199 --> 00:38:18,840
Head back early.

544
00:38:19,960 --> 00:38:20,599
We're taking off, Brother Biao.

545
00:38:24,559 --> 00:38:25,280
Ah Kai,

546
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:27,639
stay behind for a moment.

547
00:38:31,440 --> 00:38:33,039
Today's operation was leaked.

548
00:38:34,039 --> 00:38:35,679
There are indeed many suspicious details.

549
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:39,280
Have traffic control pull up today's...

550
00:38:39,280 --> 00:38:41,000
...surveillance footage along the routes.

551
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:42,440
See what they turn up.

552
00:38:48,679 --> 00:38:50,039
We've spooked the targets this time,

553
00:38:50,519 --> 00:38:52,719
who knows when they'll deal again.

554
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,079
Once you reach the undercover,

555
00:38:55,559 --> 00:38:56,800
confirm his safety first.

556
00:38:57,079 --> 00:38:59,199
If there's any risk of his cover blowing,

557
00:38:59,679 --> 00:39:00,880
order him to abort immediately.

558
00:39:02,159 --> 00:39:02,599
Yes, sir!

559
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,480
As for Qian Feng and the logistics firm,

560
00:39:10,119 --> 00:39:10,920
we need to speed that up as well.

561
00:39:12,719 --> 00:39:14,800
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan's investigation—

562
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:16,679
hand it over to Li Xiao for now.

563
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:18,079
Yes, sir!

564
00:39:36,599 --> 00:39:38,079
Do you know why I had you stay?

565
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,480
The cops tailed us today.

566
00:39:45,320 --> 00:39:46,760
There's a Mole among us.

567
00:39:48,719 --> 00:39:49,199
Ah Kai,

568
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:51,360
help me break this down.

569
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:53,119
Out of these few guys,

570
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:54,880
who could be the Mole?

571
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:01,079
Weizi has been with you the longest.

572
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:03,199
It definitely can't be him.

573
00:40:03,599 --> 00:40:05,679
Dana knows all your businesses,

574
00:40:06,119 --> 00:40:08,400
and he even runs the casino himself.

575
00:40:09,199 --> 00:40:10,480
If he were the Mole,

576
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:12,719
the cops would've nailed you long ago.

577
00:40:13,079 --> 00:40:14,119
They wouldn't have waited until now.

578
00:40:15,800 --> 00:40:16,559
Xiaokang,

579
00:40:18,039 --> 00:40:18,840
it can't be him either.

580
00:40:20,119 --> 00:40:21,639
Though he's been with you the shortest,

581
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:23,920
he has a criminal record.

582
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:27,360
That record is just what he claims.

583
00:40:29,440 --> 00:40:31,719
That kid runs with a sketchy crowd.

584
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:35,960
Ah Kai,

585
00:40:36,199 --> 00:40:36,639
here's what we'll do.

586
00:40:37,119 --> 00:40:38,440
Look into Xiaokang for me.

587
00:40:41,159 --> 00:40:43,079
I hope my suspicion is wrong.

588
00:40:45,079 --> 00:40:46,639
But then again,

589
00:40:47,079 --> 00:40:48,599
if he really is the Mole,

590
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:54,239
I'll turn him into a ghost first.

591
00:40:57,039 --> 00:40:57,559
I'll handle it.

592
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:21,599
The Mekong is Asia's largest river system,

593
00:41:21,880 --> 00:41:24,840
crossing China, Country M, Laos, Cambodia,

594
00:41:25,039 --> 00:41:25,679
and Vietnam.

595
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:29,519
What we often call Jiechan State

596
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:32,960
lies at the border of Country M, Laos, and Thailand,

597
00:41:33,039 --> 00:41:35,559
covering 194,000 square kilometers.

598
00:41:35,639 --> 00:41:36,519
For a long time,

599
00:41:36,960 --> 00:41:38,119
this place has been rife with

600
00:41:38,119 --> 00:41:40,400
rebels and armed drug syndicates,

601
00:41:41,519 --> 00:41:43,280
and is known among criminals as

602
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:44,599
a paradise for adventurers.

603
00:43:06,400 --> 00:43:07,760
Shift's over. Why aren't you home yet?

604
00:43:13,639 --> 00:43:14,239
What's wrong?

605
00:43:15,199 --> 00:43:16,039
Can't write it?

606
00:43:17,000 --> 00:43:18,760
Want to borrow my old resignation letter

607
00:43:18,760 --> 00:43:19,800
for reference?
